            A bitmask indicating the indices of the
            bandwidths that are to be enabled (1) and disabled (0). Only the lowest
            ::amdsmi_frequencies_t::num_supported (of ::amdsmi_pcie_bandwidth_t) bits of
            this mask are relevant.

